    "title": "Disrupted barriers, evolved risks: toward precision One Health in arthropod allergy",
    "authors": [
      "Dan Li",
      "Wan-Fang Zhang",
      "Yuan-Ping Deng",
      "De-Yong Duan",
      "Wei Liu",
      "Yi-Tian Fu",
